<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lankan forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lankan forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan foreign exchange market was closed for a Buddhist holiday on Friday. Dealing will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Sri Lankan rupee firmed against the dollar, closing at 58.45 after opening at 58.48.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
